opennyai_summary.facts:
. 1 was allegedly thrown out of her matrimonial home on 13.03.2015, and thereafter, she had filed a petition under Section 125 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 [hereafter Cr.P.C.
], i.e. MT No. 81/2015, seeking grant of maintenance, and had also filed a complaint under Section 12 of the Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act, 2005 [hereafter PWDV Act ], i.e. D.V. 77/2015.
Thereafter, the respondent no. 1 had withdrawn the petitions filed by her under Section 125 of Cr.P.C. and Section 12 of PWDV Act.
